{"book":"leviticus","lang":"en2","model":"glm-5.3","timestamp":"2026-08-30T00:05:43.891061942Z","verse":4,"ref":"leviticus 11:4","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":11,"translation":"Only ⟨את⟩ this you shall not eat of those that bring up the cud and of those that split the hoof: ⟨את⟩ the camel, for it brings up the cud but the hoof it does not split — it ⟨is⟩ unclean to you.","tokens":[{"surface":"אך","gloss":"only"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"this"},{"surface":"זה","gloss":"this"},{"surface":"לא","gloss":"not"},{"surface":"תאכלו","gloss":"you shall eat"},{"surface":"ממעלי","gloss":"of those that bring up"},{"surface":"הגרה","gloss":"the cud"},{"surface":"וממפריסי","gloss":"and of those that split"},{"surface":"הפרסה","gloss":"the hoof"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"the camel"},{"surface":"הגמל","gloss":"the camel"},{"surface":"כי","gloss":"for"},{"surface":"מעלה","gloss":"brings up"},{"surface":"גרה","gloss":"the cud"},{"surface":"הוא","gloss":"it"},{"surface":"ופרסה","gloss":"but the hoof"},{"surface":"איננו","gloss":"does not"},{"surface":"מפריס","gloss":"split"},{"surface":"טמא","gloss":"unclean"},{"surface":"הוא","gloss":"it"},{"surface":"לכם","gloss":"to you"}]}